; dinput8.def - module name only.
; Exports are provided by proxy.cpp via `extern "C" __declspec(dllexport)`
; and undecorated by the linker flag -Wl,--kill-at (see NEW_SESSION_INSTRUCTIONS.md).
; The old forwarding-style EXPORTS block was removed: on the 32-bit mingw target
; it produced a forward string of "_dinput8_real.DirectInput8Create" (stray leading
; underscore) that Windows could not resolve. proxy.cpp loads the real system
; dinput8.dll at runtime instead, which is robust and needs no dinput8_real.dll copy.
LIBRARY dinput8
